          "snippet": {
            "line": 403,
            "text": "theorem renormalized_decomposition (F : Profile) (XR : ℝ) (c : ℝ → Coeff) (eta X : ℝ) :\n    H F XR c (X, eta) - OutgoingDilation.powerH F XR X =\n      (OutgoingDilation.H F XR (X, eta) - OutgoingDilation.powerH F XR X) + changeRow F XR c eta 2 X"
